{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_044_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6b760d9a8eeea21fa60c52fc927aec66208bbb284b1044189051e672f0ab8b5a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74621d8fc4290323dc092c094f989d2605c06741fb26814fb7d9cbe779e175e7",
      "text": "古论挑的那家店的料理，味道都很不错啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7245fad53b02210e865ffb11e8b836559d47afb7e8290e2e4d82179e1ffeda9",
      "text": "能让今天的主角满意，我也很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78c64c16d07a7cec27d1ef000e661b134fb5cabd3e1f9b14045413450834b102",
      "text": "我还知道其他海鲜很好吃的店。\n下一次生日，去海鲜市场怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b4de23d8137b34db0a960f33660fac02835100bfda029159b2ced9a0d9f5fa",
      "text": "明年的事就明年再定吧～。\n想带去吃的店说不定到时候就变了嘛～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16f8b13a3a86017c6f90ccd5afb3a4884477b7b5b2cf412b4903d94562df7ad0",
      "text": "哈哈，正如北村所说啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43018ea82d1052a9b893dbf2f3210b915a1577d6a6d2fb7947e88680b0fb5c90",
      "text": "克里斯先生，到时候我们3人再一起定吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b10926ea25a2d9a9196314835abff7eb5605f0143b16b8037464f705cce80dd9",
      "text": "好的，说得也是。\n下次我再带您去雨彦会喜欢的店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d91ce91a6d38f6cf445ab0e225b3c7745dcbabdb20962d3446c3a29f8a343a3b",
      "text": "那就拜托啦。……好啦，差不多该解散了吧。\n街上变装的人也陆陆续续多起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d23a2b7d2cdec68adf30b4b4325ff91660be18fecc8fe2867e5aa1fd3f70e1e9",
      "text": "今天再次谢谢你们啦。\n等你们过生日的时候，我也好好回礼的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cd08eb76b8b9502b4671340b27193605d9f0bc6a250255dc66c80a7d27a7429",
      "text": "好的，我很期待明年的生日。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90eb3e74c3636dad3487234babade90c982c4a8e7460c4b9832debe47e192435",
      "text": "请手下留情哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
